#: ../../configuration.rst:347
msgid ""
"Up to *Apple School Manager Connector* version 5.1.1, app settings and "
"UCR variables held the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Bis zur Version 5.1.1 von *Apple School Manager Connector* enthielten "
"App-Einstellungen und UCR-Variablen die Konfiguration."

#: ../../configuration.rst:350
msgid ""
"The update to version 6.0.0 moves their values to the settings file and "
"removes the UCR variables. You don't need to do anything. The password "
"stays in :file:`/etc/asm.secret`. The settings file refers to "
":file:`/etc/asm.secret`. The account gets the name ``default``."
msgstr ""
"Das Update auf Version 6.0.0 überträgt ihre Werte in die "
"Einstellungsdatei und entfernt die UCR-Variablen. Sie müssen nichts tun. "
"Das Passwort bleibt in :file:`/etc/asm.secret`, und die Einstellungsdatei"
" verweist darauf. Das Konto erhält den Namen ``default``."

#: ../../configuration.rst:357
msgid ""
":numref:`configuration-accounts-migration-mapping-table` maps the former "
